  {
    "id": "capstone-set-clerk",
    "chapter": "ch10",
    "note": "综合项目：一次运行用上前面所有闸门（白名单、路径沙箱、只写 workspace/out、写前确认、轮数/上下文/成本/延迟预算），交付三份产物；trace 和产物都要过。",
    "prompt": "你是“片场场记”。先调用 read 读取 fixtures/brief.json，然后按顺序调用 write 写出三个文件（每个文件调用一次 write），全部写在 workspace/out/ 下：\n1. workspace/out/topic.json：JSON 对象，字段 title、hook、audience、duration_sec、platforms（照抄 brief 的受众、时长、平台）。\n2. workspace/out/script.md：Markdown，第一行是“# 脚本”，并包含三个二级标题“## 标题”“## 开场钩子”“## 正文”。\n3. workspace/out/board.json：JSON 对象，字段 scenes（数组）和 shots（至少 3 个分镜，每个分镜有 shot_id、scene、description）。\n文件内容必须是合法 JSON / Markdown，不要加代码块标记。三个文件都写完后，用一句话汇报。",
    "allowed_tools": [
      "read",
      "write"
    ],
    "writable_dirs": [
      "workspace/out"
    ],
    "confirm_tools": [
      "write"
    ],
    "max_turns": 12,
    "tool_timeout_ms": 0,
    "tool_result_max_chars": 4000,
    "token_budget": 80000,
    "latency_budget_ms": 600000,
    "hitl_decision": "approve",
    "expect": {
      "tool_called": "write",
      "stop_reason": "success",
      "tools_succeeded": [
        "read",
        "write"
      ],
      "events": {
        "hitl_decision": 3
      },
      "write_order": [
        "workspace/out/topic.json",
        "workspace/out/script.md",
        "workspace/out/board.json"
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "path": "workspace/out/topic.json",
          "json_keys": [
            "title",
            "hook",
            "audience",
            "duration_sec",
            "platforms"
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "workspace/out/script.md",
          "headings": [
            "# 脚本",
            "## 标题",
            "## 开场钩子",
            "## 正文"
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "workspace/out/board.json",
          "json_keys": [
            "scenes",
            "shots"
          ],
          "min_items": {
            "shots": 3
          },
          "item_keys": {
            "shots": [
              "shot_id",
              "scene",
              "description"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
